  "question": "Series context: as a Bloomberg Data Analyst you have historical stock data for the FAANG stocks (Part 1 covers highest and lowest open prices by month).\n\nLikely ask (unverified): compare each stock's closing price month over month (the change from the previous month), per ticker.\n\nNot available: the exact wording, output columns, example rows and expected output.",
